  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This wonderful, three-story beach house is located on the beach side of 30A and has all the charm you need to relax and enjoy the beautiful beaches of Seagrove and the quaint atmosphere of Scenic 30-A. 'Always Summer' is a 3+ bedroom, 3.5 bathroom beach home and is perfect for family gatherings/groups of friends and comfortably sleeps 10. It's nicely furnished, affordable, and enjoys a less than 5 minute walk to the family-friendly beach thru quiet streets. After your fill of the ocean, return to the private swimming pool and patio for outdoor relaxing and entertaining. (Note: The pool can be heated during the cooler months for an additional charge of $30/day.)<br><br>House includes a lovely first floor living area with 50\" flatscreen/DVD and opens to the dining area, side dining porch, and cheery, fully-stocked kitchen with everything you will need. The first floor also includes a queen bedroom and full bath ideal for guests who need to avoid stairs, and a laundry room with full-sized washer and dryer for your convenience. <br><br>The second floor provides two spacious master suites, giving comfort and privacy to parties vacationing together. Each suite includes a private bath and flatscreen TV/ DVD while the front master suite includes a workspace and opens onto a private balcony, and the back master suite views the pool and also includes a bunk bed.<br><br>The third floor 'Tower Room' with half bath can be used as an extra bedroom, game room, kid hang-out, or a place to enjoy a good book on a hot afternoon. Walk onto the 'Observation Deck' for star gazing and long conversations into the summer night! <br><br>No matter the season, 'Always Summer' is a great choice for your family vacation! :-D <br><br>Please note: We have only have two parking spots on a paved driveway at our home. There is no street parking on our street. A public beach access parking lot is within a 3 minute walk. <br>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Weekly Discount! Private Heated Pool! Easy Walk to Beach! Close to Seaside!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
